<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL-Read-Rite,disk drives firm.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL-Read-Rite,disk drives firm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in computer disk drive manufacturers are expected to firm Thursday with buying motivated by news of healthy quarterly earnings from two such companies.</p>
<p>Traders said Read-Rite Corp and Western Digital Corp are expected to trade higher on their earnings reports released last night, gains that will likely support the overall group.</p>
<p>In pre-open trade, Western Digital rose three to 48-1/2 while Read-Rite was untraded but bid 3/8 above its 17-3/8 Nasdaq close.</p>
